    "body": "## Summary\n\nConsolidate four model documentation additions into a single PR as requested by maintainers to reduce churn.\n\n**Models added:**\n- **google/gemma-2-2b-it** (Gemma 2)\n- **ibm-granite/granite-swash-2b** (Granite SWA - sliding window attention)\n- **Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B** (Qwen 3 mini)\n\nAll models validated on H100 NVL with vLLM v0.31.0.\n\n## Rationale\n\nPer feedback on individual PRs (#43656, #53403, #56339, #56475), maintainers prefer batching multiple documentation additions into a single PR to reduce merge churn and noise.\n\n## Test Plan\n\nModels already validated via determinism tests. This PR only updates documentation list.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
