      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "This PR consolidates the following four individual documentation PRs that were previously open:\n- #43656 (Gemma 2)\n- #53403 (Qwen3-0.6B)\n- #56339 (PLaMo3)\n- #56475 (Granite MoE SWA)\n\nPer @hmellor's feedback that one-liner PRs should be batched, all four models are now documented in a single change to reduce merge churn. The four individual PRs have been closed.\n\nAll models validated on H100 NVL with v0.31.0. Ready to merge.",
